{"id":"fecha","lemma":"fecha","pos":"noun","rank":1414,"glosses":["date (that which specifies the time when something was made)","date (a specific day in time at which a transaction or event takes place)"],"ipa":"/ˈfet͡ʃa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"fechas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a4/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-fecha.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Qué fecha es hoy?","en":"What's today's date?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453748"},{"text":"No es fácil memorizar fechas.","en":"It isn't easy to memorize dates."},{"text":"Me equivoqué de fecha.","en":"I got the date wrong.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/921292"},{"text":"¿Olvidé escribir la fecha?","en":"Did I forget to write the date?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/806197"},{"text":"La fecha límite fue ayer.","en":"The deadline was yesterday.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/582494"}]}